      "id": "claim_582624e6ba514810bdb789729d4765b2",
      "statement": "LangChain's CI/CD infrastructure is built on three interconnected GitHub Actions workflows: check_diffs.yml (PR change detection and dynamic test matrix generation), integration_tests.yml (scheduled daily integration testing against live APIs), and _release.yml (PyPI publication with validation gates).",
