      "statement": "_lint.yml and _test.yml are reusable workflows that accept working-directory and python-version inputs, run on ubuntu-latest with 20-minute timeouts, use the custom uv_setup action with caching, and handle conditional dependency installation for partner packages that require integration test dependencies alongside unit test dependencies.",
