      "statement": "_release.yml separates the build job (reads source, builds distribution, outputs pkg-name/version/checksums) from publish jobs, ensuring that a compromised build step cannot access PyPI credentials or GitHub write permissions, with build job running in Release environment but having only contents:read permission.",
